From a6024b28711465815a96865bcaa07ffe21e75877 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JusDots <eng@jusdots.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 16:53:45 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] JusBrowse: webpage rendering shell - rounded card + bottom
 title pill

Matches design: inset rounded engine (28dp, 10dp margins, dark shell
#0A0C0F) and centered bottom pill showing page title/host (or 'page
title' placeholder, 'cats' for search). Hides default toolbar to give
full web-content focus as in mockup.
---
